# Finding 3b (RESULTS.md), new, a clock effect. The wall clock steps back by 30 days before step
# 2, right after the rollback of r3. The check finds r3's half message without its record (the
# batch of records waits by the wall clock) and stored 30 days "after" the check began, so it
# stops there at every round. No later transaction is checked: u17, u20 and u44, whose producers
# answered "unknown", are never committed: VIOLATION [jobs.no-loss] u17 was acknowledged to
# process 17 at 46.316 s and never delivered in group w of channel j, which was drained.
# expect: violation      (new, a clock effect: TransactionalMessageServiceImpl measures with the wall clock)
disk=none | run T=2:-2592000
